%%% note
壊れた UTF-8 の本文を text/plain で受け、DW の文字単位の処理 (sizeOf、添字、splitBy、upper、逆順) を確かめる。
実 Mule は JDK の UTF-8 の decoder で読む (壊れた並びの長さは maximal subpart。ただし ED の後の範囲外の継続バイトはまとめて 1 つ)。
%%% port 18578
%%% request POST /count base64
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Se2s
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "n": 1,
  "head": null,
  "tail": "I",
  "chars": [
    "I"
  ],
  "up": "I",
  "rev": "I"
}
%%% request POST /count base64
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Ye2ggGI=
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "n": 1,
  "head": null,
  "tail": "a",
  "chars": [
    "a"
  ],
  "up": "A",
  "rev": "a"
}
